WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:01,620
No no

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,020
I wasn't the one who picked you up

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,020
I was the one who moved you up? Right?

4
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,020
Because you have to move your fleshy self

5
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:10,420
Okay, senior, you said I'm fat

6
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:13,340
Okay, let's go

7
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,140
Counting today, it’s only been two days.

8
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,340
We have to survive

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,140
Senior, are you going to touch the box today?

10
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,540
Now we have locations for four boxes

11
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,740
There is one that is closer

12
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,940
The other three will take almost half a day to walk.

13
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,540
The heart of the box is random

14
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,740
Not necessarily nearby

15
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:29,740
Meat is enough

16
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:30,740
But just eating meat is not enough

17
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,140
Imbalanced nutrition causes indigestion

18
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,140
It will also wear down the body

19
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,140
And eating meat without seasoning for two months in a row

20
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,800
Can drive people crazy

21
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,800
While there is still time

22
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,860
Time to find spices and vegetables

23
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,860
Where is that box?

24
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,860
In the forest, more than two thousand meters away
